{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An abandoned planet for millennia. You, a humanoid from the future, have a mission: dig, find relics, and solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dig:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unearth strange objects and artifacts left by humans. Each excavation is an opportunity to discover something useful or bizarre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Dig.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Relics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover items that seem to have come out of a science fiction movie, accompanied by curious descriptions. Why is a gas mask called a &quot;flatulence protection device&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Relic.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face challenges that require reasoning and creativity. Each solved puzzle brings more fun and new relics. You don't need to be an archaeologist to unravel the mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Puzzle.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turn into Fuel:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convert these strange objects into fuel for your ship and prepare to leave this forgotten planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Fuel.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig, discover, solve puzzles, and laugh at the oddities of the past. An adventure where the curiosities of the past become the fuel of your future!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603570?t=1744476665","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/627bf3344dfa063d7aef238619200193aa8e4954/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744476665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/51d68532bcee864a46838ba0fe557097eea3375e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744476665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/51d68532bcee864a46838ba0fe557097eea3375e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744476665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An abandoned planet for millennia. You, a humanoid from the future, have a mission: dig, find relics, and solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dig:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unearth strange objects and artifacts left by humans. Each excavation is an opportunity to discover something useful or bizarre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Dig.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Relics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover items that seem to have come out of a science fiction movie, accompanied by curious descriptions. Why is a gas mask called a &quot;flatulence protection device&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Relic.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face challenges that require reasoning and creativity. Each solved puzzle brings more fun and new relics. You don't need to be an archaeologist to unravel the mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Puzzle.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turn into Fuel:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convert these strange objects into fuel for your ship and prepare to leave this forgotten planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/GIF_Fuel.gif?t=1744476665\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig, discover, solve puzzles, and laugh at the oddities of the past. An adventure where the curiosities of the past become the fuel of your future!</p>","developers":["Barshem Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/9e52c487a58eeb42052bf9f0159d589074094cf1/header.jpg?t=1744476665","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123813,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123813/movie480.mp4?t=1744476663","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123813/movie_max.mp4?t=1744476663"},"name":"Dig&Decode","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123813/c798888de6b16b963af30eea9f363f1073646377/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744476663","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123813/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744476663","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123813/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744476663"}}],"name":"Di